<BaseLayout
  title={"Managed IT Services & Support in Austin | Bleufoot"}
  description={"Proactive managed IT services for Austin businesses, including help desk support, endpoint management, monitoring, patching, cloud support, and security."}
  canonical={"https://www.bleufoot.com/managed-services"}
  robots={"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"}
  activePage="services"
  openGraph={{"title": "Managed IT Services & Support in Austin | Bleufoot", "description": "Proactive managed IT services including help desk support, endpoint management, monitoring, patching, cloud support, and security.", "url": "https://www.bleufoot.com/managed-services", "image": "https://www.bleufoot.com/assets/img/og-image.png", "imageType": "image/png", "imageWidth": "1200", "imageHeight": "630", "imageAlt": "Bleufoot Solutions technology services"}}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><h4>Managed Technology Services</h4></div><h1>Proactive technology support that keeps your business reliable, secure, and productive.</h1><p>Managed services should do more than respond when something breaks. Bleufoot monitors, maintains, supports, documents, and improves your technology environment.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><ul><li>User support</li><li>Endpoint management</li><li>Monitoring and maintenance</li><li>Security-focused operations</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker"><h4>Support that works ahead of problems</h4></div><h2>Reliable support for the systems, users, and devices your business depends on.</h2></div><p>Our managed services simplify technology operations, reduce disruptions, improve the employee experience, and create better visibility.</p></div>
<div class="grid grid-3">
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><path d="M5 13h3v6H5zM16 13h3v6h-3z"></path><path d="M16 19a4 4 0 0 1-4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>User &amp; Help Desk Support</h3><p>Professional assistance for workstation issues, accounts, access, applications, printers, devices, and common user needs.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="11" rx="2" width="16" x="4" y="5"></rect><path d="M8 21h8M12 16v5"></path></svg></span><h3>Endpoint &amp; Device Management</h3><p>Configuration, updates, security controls, maintenance, and lifecycle planning for business devices.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Monitoring &amp; Maintenance</h3><p>Visibility into critical systems, devices, services, and performance indicators before small issues become major disruptions.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5 5L3 18v3h3l6.7-6.7a4 4 0 0 0 5-5l-2.4 2.4-2.8-2.8 2.2-2.6z"></path></svg></span><h3>Patch &amp; Update Management</h3><p>A consistent approach to software updates, operating system patches, and routine maintenance.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 19H8a5 5 0 1 1 1.1-9.9A6 6 0 0 1 20 12.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 17.5 19z"></path></svg></span><h3>Cloud Productivity Support</h3><p>Support for Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, SaaS tools, email, collaboration, permissions, and user access.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Security-Focused Operations</h3><p>Practical controls, visibility, user support, patching, endpoint protection, backups, and access management.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">
<h4>Move beyond reactive support</h4>
</div>
<h2>
      Give your team dependable technology support before small issues become business disruptions.
    </h2>
<p>
      Whether you need ongoing user support, endpoint management,
      monitoring, patching, cloud administration, documentation,
      or additional support for an internal IT team, Bleufoot can
      help build a practical managed-services plan around your business.
    </p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="/quote-request?service=Managed%20Technology%20Services">
  Discuss Managed Technology Services →
</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact">
        Ask a Support Question
      </a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
